CPLEX Parameter File Version 22.1.1.0
# Suggested for plexos2gtopt-derived MIPs (large unit-commitment MIPs
# with a sizeable integer share).
#
# Two recommended overrides on top of CPLEX defaults:
#
#   1. CPXPARAM_MIP_Cuts_Gomory = 2
#      More aggressive Gomory cut generation, suggested by CPLEX's own
#      `tools tune` on a representative LP.
#
#   2. CPXPARAM_LPMethod = 4
#      Barrier for the root relaxation of these large cold-start LPs,
#      where simplex variants can stall.
#
# Caveat: forcing barrier here makes warm-started SDDP iteration LPs
# slower (dual simplex would be faster on those).  If this same prm is
# loaded under SDDP, comment out the LPMethod line and let CPLEX's
# auto-pick choose dual on warm bases.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
CPXPARAM_MIP_Cuts_Gomory                        2
CPXPARAM_LPMethod                               4
